    "v2_accordion_y34QGc": {
      "type": "v2_accordion",
      "blocks": {
        "accordion_row_hFa9bz": {
          "type": "accordion_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What support will I get during my course? ",
            "row_content": "<p>You’ll have unlimited support throughout your learning journey. Our dedicated support team is here to help via email, phone, video call, or face-to-face contact whenever needed. We’ll also keep in regular touch to make sure you’re progressing confidently and have everything you need to succeed.</p>"
          }
        },
        "accordion_row_XXqcyj": {
          "type": "accordion_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What technology will I need? ",
            "row_content": "<p> You will need a computer, laptop or tablet with a reliable internet connection to access your e learning and webinars. If you have a virtual assessment, you will also need a device capable of recording video such as a smartphone.</p>"
          }
        },
        "accordion_row_7fggDd": {
          "type": "accordion_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How will I be assessed?",
            "row_content": "<p>Each course includes a combination of coursework, theory exams, and practical assessments. </p><p>You’ll book onto an assessment day for your exams — available regularly throughout the week and on weekends, so finding a suitable date is easy. On your assessment day, you can complete any required theory and/or practical exams under the guidance of our qualified assessors. </p>"
          }
        },
        "accordion_row_XkH9ne": {
          "type": "accordion_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What happens if I do not pass an assessment the first time? ",
            "row_content": "<p>You can resubmit coursework at no extra cost. For theory or practical assessments there may be a small fee after three attempts. We will always work with you to address any areas you find challenging so that you can move forward confidently.</p>"
          }
        },
        "accordion_row_XxigFE": {
          "type": "accordion_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How long will I have access to my course? ",
            "row_content": "<p>Your access lasts for 12 months from the date you enrol. If you need more time we can arrange an extension for a small additional fee.</p>"
          }
        },
        "accordion_row_YXffNg": {
          "type": "accordion_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How long does it take to complete my course? ",
            "row_content": "<p>Most students complete their qualification within 4–6 months when studying part-time. </p><p>However, if you’re looking to qualify sooner, we offer accelerated learning options so you can complete your course more quickly - the pace is entirely up to you. </p>"
          }
        },
        "accordion_row_RXdA64": {
          "type": "accordion_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Do you offer support for learners with additional needs? ",
            "row_content": "<p>Yes. We are committed to making our training accessible to everyone. Please let us know about any specific needs before or during your studies so that we can support you appropriately.</p>"
          }
        },
        "accordion_row_pPtkDb": {
          "type": "accordion_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "When can I start my course? ",
            "row_content": "<p>We offer rolling enrolment so you can start at a time that suits you best. Many learners choose to begin straight away to build on their motivation.</p>"
          }
        },
        "accordion_row_ffYQcA": {
          "type": "accordion_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Can I defer my studies? ",
            "row_content": "<p> Yes. If your circumstances change, we can discuss deferral options and help you arrange to restart when you are ready.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
