          "settings": {
            "heading": "What about courses delivered by partner providers? ",
            "row_content": "<p> If you enrol on a course delivered by one of our partner providers, then refunds and cancellations are handled by them directly. We will always give you their details, so you know exactly who to speak to.</p>"
