          "type": "accordion_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What can I do once I qualify? ",
            "row_content": "<p>Graduates from our courses work as personal trainers, fitness instructors and exercise specialists in gyms, leisure centres and health clubs. Many set up as self-employed trainers and some move into areas such as nutrition, sports coaching or working with specialist populations. Your qualification can also be used as a stepping stone to advance or niche fitness training.</p>"
